<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth travelled to Caracas and signed a new military partnership with the interim Venezuelan government, expanding cooperation to target drug trafficking and designating Venezuela a compliant security partner, while meeting interim president and Delcy Rodriguez. The United States also launched a Caribbean operation during which a marine died after falling overboard. The deal marks a broader security engagement than earlier agreements focused solely on bilateral ties. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQaDk1dWVDTWtxcHkxQjE0dS1GVzZ1WXhpbmhyZkNDc0F2TlYteGpmLWxabEE2QXAwZnUwYmRKVzQ4aUlIUGFxZl9BUHM1NDJXUEhiUEUzaEJVaks1U1JYVkl4U2hsQWVLOVN0MUZQcFZqQ3VPSDBmLVhVSUZKZXl2bWpIZWRJQzJOS01femYwRlBCLXNPc2owa0t4SmFpWWZqSk5kRGJ1ZXIxcXByRFpMYmdWRHVpUlBhZGN2RA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxONFk1RlZIUXh1dXlFVHVzSlh1YjVibG0wdV81RS1na0Ywc3p5MEhaOXB6YlREV3FFRzJpM1VhMFgzYnNLU3hvaXBXOUh4TkpXa01XYTRzS1o1R0VXcHhzZXc4ZkRZYUIxRVVpRXB6Zm9BRUNMQlE5aGFySVUzR2RpVmpsV1A2UFNSLTRITEZNVG5BdUlZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOTlQtc0ZobkZaYXZoanl5Y2pMODJndHlKVDh5amVsTGY4TzA3Wmd1VklyeG5WWEpPbnk4bEl1WUF2VGxTejNmSE1xRkZhTHJWZ2dZZE95d2pzMThXUTBuMFlUZ2R5X3o3bVpzeW1JaTNtZ0xLLWFqcWMyUlN5dWs1ZmVQaFladmh5SEpSTHpMT2Fxc0Zra0c5a0ZOcjdZSW5W?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n